- These files belong to an independent Git repository, not to ASpectra.
- Read that repository's AGENTS.md first; it governs this code.
- Commit inside that repository through its own git flow, never at the ASpectra root.
- Cross-repository changes follow @docs/development/cross-repository-changes.md.
